concept:telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991-sch-2-sec-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "2 Commencement"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-2 ;
    values:originalText "(1) Part 1 commences on the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent.  (2) Part 2, Part 3 (except section 24) and Part 4 commence on 1 July 1991.  (3) Section 24 and Part 5 commence on the day fixed under subsection 2(1) of the Australian and Overseas Telecommunications Corporation Act 1991.    Telecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments) Act 1991  Compilation date: 1/7/16 Registered: 18/7/16" ;
    skos:definition "(1) Part 1 commences on the day on which this Act receives the Royal Assent.  (2) Part 2, Part 3 (except section 24) and Part 4 commence on 1 July 1991.  (3) Section 24 and Part 5 commence on the day fixed under subsection 2(1) of the Australian and Overseas Telecommunications Corporation Act 1991.    Telecommunications (Transitional Provisions and Consequential Amendments) Act 1991  Compilation date: 1/7/16 Registered: 18/7/16"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d460715a52f2ffad95fdc1ccf38e39b5500892d18b7a2902a1b521f95b0d3485" ;
