concept:telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991-sch-2-sec-14 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "14 Effect of standards determined under section 106 of the"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-2-sec-14 ;
    values:originalText "Telecommunications Act 1989  A technical standard that, immediately before the repeal of section 106 of the Telecommunications Act 1989, was in force under that section has effect after that repeal (including for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901) as if:  (a) section 246 of the Telecommunications Act 1991 had commenced on the day when the standard was determined; and  (b) the standard had been determined under section 246 of the Telecommunications Act 1991." ;
    skos:definition "Telecommunications Act 1989  A technical standard that, immediately before the repeal of section 106 of the Telecommunications Act 1989, was in force under that section has effect after that repeal (including for the purposes of section 46A of the Acts Interpretation Act 1901) as if:  (a) section 246 of the Telecommunications Act 1991 had commenced on the day when the standard was determined; and  (b) the standard had been determined under section 246 of the Telecommunications Act 1991."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "4b45627c8d0cf5d402d0dd9412c57158fc20cb9a4567cdc1d4b244174c4ddc42" ;
    cof:pageNumber "10"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "A technical standard has effect after repeal as if section 246 of the Telecommunications Act 1991 had commenced." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
    prov:wasDerivedFrom <telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991.pdf> ;
    dc:source "telecommunications-transitional-provisions-and-consequential-amendments-act-1991.pdf, p.10" ;
